# Internal working notes and a superseded draft. CLAUDE.md 17 keeps design
# thinking, failure analysis, and editing records in the Obsidian vault rather
# than the repository; STYLE_REVIEW and PERSONA_AUDIT both declare themselves
# outside the submission package, and MANUSCRIPT.md is the pre-rewrite draft
# that paper.tex replaces (a second competing paper document is exactly the
# drift PAPER.md is generated to prevent).
MANUSCRIPT.md
APPENDIX_METHODS.md
PERSONA_AUDIT.md
RESEARCH_REASSESSMENT.md
STYLE_REVIEW.md
